{"__inputs":[{"name":"DS_LOKI","label":"Loki","type":"datasource","pluginId":"loki"}],"__requires":[{"type":"grafana","id":"grafana","name":"Grafana","version":"12.0.0"},{"type":"datasource","id":"loki","name":"Loki","version":"1.0.0"},{"type":"panel","id":"table","name":"Table","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"stat","name":"Stat","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"timeseries","name":"Time series","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"text","name":"Text","version":""}],"uid":"copilot-loki-model-intelligence","title":"Copilot \u2014 Model and Feature Usage Intelligence","description":"Cross-user analysis of model and feature adoption from Loki. Identifies expensive model usage, fastest-growing features, and users driving premium model consumption.","tags":["copilot","loki","model","feature","intelligence"],"timezone":"browser","schemaVersion":39,"version":1,"refresh":"1h","time":{"from":"now-28d","to":"now"},"graphTooltip":1,"templating":{"list":[{"name":"enterprise","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"loki","uid":"${DS_LOKI}"},"query":"label_values(enterprise)","refresh":2,"multi":false,"includeAll":false,"label":"Enterprise","current":{},"options":[],"hide":0}]},"panels":[{"id":1,"type":"text","title":"About This Dashboard","gridPos":{"h":5,"w":24,"x":0,"y":0},"options":{"mode":"markdown","content":"## Copilot Model and Feature Usage Intelligence\n\nCross-user analysis of which models and features are being used across the enterprise. Sourced from Loki structured logs which contain per-user per-day model and feature breakdowns not available in VictoriaMetrics.\n\n**Key questions this dashboard answers:**\n- Which users are consuming the most premium model prompts?\n- Which features are being adopted fastest?\n- How many users used agent features this week?\n- Which model is driving the most activity?\n\n**Data source:** Loki `{enterprise=\"sherwin-williams\", log_source=\"copilot_exporter\"}` \u2014 28-day query window maximum."}},{"id":100,"type":"row","title":